{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11104050","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11104050","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1110405001:0":{"text":"動くな！何者だ？どこから来た？どこへ行くつもりだ？","source_cn":"站住。你们是谁？哪儿来的？要去哪儿？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5636648B508421D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1110405001":{"text":"動くな！何者だ？どこから来た？どこへ行くつもりだ？","source_cn":"站住。你们是谁？哪儿来的？要去哪儿？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5636648B508421D9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1110405002:0":{"text":"残陽の武闘場？もうすぐ戦歌祭が始まる。ということは、お前たちは参加者か？","source_cn":"残阳武斗场？战歌节要开始了，你们难道是参赛的勇士？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E185F591B089E75","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1110405003:0":{"text":"……うん、僕たち戦歌祭に参加するんだ。","source_cn":"……是的，我们是战歌节的参赛者。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D19923E1C0070D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1110405006:1":{"text":"お前たちはまだ試練の途中だろう？正式な参加者ではないはずだ。","source_cn":"我怎么听说你们还在试炼，没有获得承认呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7B6A258FEF1E030","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1110405007:0":{"text":"オレたちは必ず参加資格を手にする。","source_cn":"我们一定会获得参赛资格。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x06027A3879962C9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1110405008:0":{"text":"口だけはいっちょ前だな！それにしても、お前どこかで見た顔だな？うちから追放されたババリアのガキに似てるような……？","source_cn":"好大的口气！不过，你小子好像有点眼熟。和我们族内被抛弃...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xACB377441FE585E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1110405009:0":{"text":"ああ、あの生まれつき毛もろくすっぽ生えてなかった熊っころか。","source_cn":"没错，生下来光秃秃的，浑身没几根熊毛——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71ED44C655DC83C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1110405010:0":{"text":"お前――","source_cn":"你——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3870CC3BBD1E5162","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1110405011:0":{"text":"ソーン、落ち着いてね！","source_cn":"索恩，冷静！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC0F7DB7ADC0B84F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1110405012:1":{"text":"……ふぅ。あんたらと昔話するつもりはない。オレたちはここを通りたいだけだ。","source_cn":"……呼，你们没必要跟我叙旧。我们只想借个路，仅此而已。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE77AE91E61BEE3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1110405013:0":{"text":"いや、だめだ。お前嘘をついてるな？生まれつき弱くて、今もそんな貧相なガタイの奴が、戦歌祭の参加者なわけがない。","source_cn":"不，不行。你不老实。生下来就是弱者，长到现在块头也不大...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA658ADEBD0552A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1110405014:0":{"text":"ああ、怪しい嘘つきは、捕らえて取り調べしないとなぁ。ほら、大人しくついてこい！","source_cn":"没错，对撒谎的可疑人士，必须带走好好盘查。跟我们走！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9477BEED2B82B8C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1110405015:0":{"text":"ふざけるな。オレたちの集落に人をよこしたくせに、何も知らないはずはないだろ！","source_cn":"别开玩笑了，你们明明什么都知道！不然，怎么会派人去骚扰...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7623D415AD937179","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1110405016:0":{"text":"そんな見え透いた口実で足止めしやがって。オレたちがビビるとでも思ってるのか？","source_cn":"现在竟然想用这种差劲借口扣下我们——是觉得我们会怕吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x285ADB5E0002F888","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1110405017:0":{"text":"ソーン、落ち着いてってば！ここは彼らの縄張りなんだよ。もっと慎重になって！","source_cn":"索恩，别冲动！这里是他们的领地，我们不能轻举妄动！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2582AE0813C75735","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1110405018:0":{"text":"今ことを大きくしたら、試練に間に合わなくなるかもしれないよ！父ちゃんとの約束を思い出して！","source_cn":"现在把事情闹大，我们可能会错过试炼的！想想和老爹的约定吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x740ED34D4DA0AB41","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1110405019:0":{"text":"……分かったよ。","source_cn":"……我明白了，阿尔萨。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA58968B56CC47DB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1110405020:0":{"text":"そうそう、大人しくしてればこっちも手間が省ける。こいつらを本営へ連れてくぞ！","source_cn":"乖乖得多好啊，省了我们多少事！走，带这些人去主营！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E1E220112FA72B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:0:1":{"text":"残陽の武闘場から来た。","source_cn":"残阳武斗场来的","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD0801229DD2D2AAD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"残陽の武闘場から来た。","female":"残陽の武闘場から来たのよ。","variant_male_record_index":"63204","variant_female_record_index":"63205","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1110405004:0":{"text":"戦神峰？あそこに行けるのは戦歌祭の勇士たちだけだ。","source_cn":"战神峰？除了战歌节的勇士们，没人能去战神峰。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3628F86751EAE578","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"戦神峰？あそこに行けるのは戦歌祭の勇士たちだけだ。","female":"戦神峰？あそこに行けるのは戦歌祭の勇士たちだけだ。","variant_male_record_index":"120949","variant_female_record_index":"120950","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1110405005:0":{"text":"……その通りだ。オレとアルサは戦歌祭の参加者だ。","source_cn":"……就像你说的，我和阿尔萨是战歌节的参赛者。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD0583C35BC373446","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:2:1:2":{"text":"戦神峰に行くんだ。","source_cn":"要去战神峰山脚","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAA85AD8041E784A9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"戦神峰に行くんだ。","female":"戦神峰に行くの。","variant_male_record_index":"63206","variant_female_record_index":"63207","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:蛮横的黑嚎守卫":{"text":"横暴な守衛","source":"蛮横的黑嚎守卫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:阿尔萨":{"text":"アルサ","source":"阿尔萨","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:挑衅的黑嚎守卫":{"text":"挑発的な守衛","source":"挑衅的黑嚎守卫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索恩":{"text":"ソーン","source":"索恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":24,"localized_text_count":23,"speaker_count":4}}